    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is Google Business Profile + local SEO for a Nashik dermatology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Google Business Profile (GMB) is your Google Maps + Google Search local listing — appears in map pack (top 3 local results) + right-panel knowledge graph. Winning GMB: fully-optimised profile + reviews velocity + posts weekly + Q&amp;A monitored + geo-tagged photos + services listed + accurate NAP + local citations + on-site local schema. In Nashik with Moderate GMB competition — 50-70 clinics ranked. College Road + Gangapur Road medical cluster., GMB competition drives 40-60% of new-patient inquiries via map pack + local search.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What GMB optimisation is essential for a Nashik dermatology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) Complete profile: name (exact business name), phone, address, category (Dermatologist primary + Skin Care Clinic + Aesthetic Clinic secondary), hours, website, appointment link, description. (2) Services listed (each procedure as service with price + description). (3) 30-100+ geo-tagged photos (facility + team + equipment + BTS + before-after with consent). (4) Weekly GMB posts (procedure spotlight + offer + event + Q&amp;A + patient testimonial). (5) Q&amp;A section monitored + populated with common patient questions + clinic-authored answers. (6) Reviews velocity: target 3-10 new reviews/month. In Nashik, Moderate GMB competition — 50-70 clinics ranked. College Road + Gangapur Road medical cluster.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we generate more Google reviews for a Nashik dermatology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Review generation programme: (1) Post-consultation WhatsApp/SMS asking for Google review within 24-48 hours (peak recall), (2) Physical QR code at reception + payment counter + review-request card, (3) Email follow-up 24hr + 7 day, (4) Google Business Profile short-URL bookmark on staff phones, (5) Incentivised staff for review requests (never incentivise reviewers — ASCI/Google policy violation), (6) Follow-up on negative reviews within 4 hours with resolution offer. Realistic target: 30-100 new Google reviews/year for Nashik dermatology clinic scaling.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
